  "problem": "Olivia and Harper are musicians. In the previous season, the decimal proportion of Olivia’s performances that were solos was $0.55,$ while $40%$ of Harper’s performances were solos. \n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nI. Less than half of Olivia's performances were solos.\n\nII. More than half of Harper's performances were solos.\n\nIII. Olivia had a greater percentage of solo performances compared to Harper.",
