  "html": "<div id=\"question-350260\" class=\"question\" style=\"display: block;\">\n                        <div class=\"questionNumber\">Question 1</div>\n\n                        \n                               \n                         \n        \n\n                        \n\n                        <div id=\"questionText-350260\" class=\"questionText\">\n                            <p></p><p>Olivia and Harper are musicians. In the previous season, the decimal proportion of Olivia’s performances that were solos was <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"1\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0.55</mn><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> while <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"2\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c25\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> of Harper’s performances were solos. </p><p></p>\n<p></p><p>Which of the following statements are true?</p><p></p>\n<ol class=\"questionStatements\"><li>  Less than half of Olivia's performances were solos. </li><li>  More than half of Harper's performances were solos. </li><li>  Olivia had a greater percentage of solo performances compared to Harper. </li></ol>                                     \n                        </div>\n\n                        \n                            <table class=\"choicesTable\">\n                                <tbody><tr>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceALetter\" class=\"choiceLetter\">\n                                          \n                                        <div id=\"question-350260-choiceA\" class=\"choiceLetterCircle\" letter=\"a\">a</div>\n                                    </td>\n                                    <td class=\"choiceText\">I and II only</td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceBLetter\" class=\"choiceLetter\">\n                                          \n                                        <div id=\"question-350260-choiceB\" class=\"choiceLetterCircle\" letter=\"b\">b</div>\n                                    </td>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceBText\" class=\"choiceText\">I only</td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceCLetter\" class=\"choiceLetter\">\n                                          \n                                        <div id=\"question-350260-choiceC\" class=\"choiceLetterCircle\" letter=\"c\">c</div>\n                                    </td>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceCText\" class=\"choiceText\">III only</td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceDLetter\" class=\"choiceLetter\">\n                                          \n                                        <div id=\"question-350260-choiceD\" class=\"choiceLetterCircle\" letter=\"d\">d</div>\n                                    </td>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceDText\" class=\"choiceText\">II only</td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceELetter\" class=\"choiceLetter\">\n                                        \n                                        <div id=\"question-350260-choiceE\" class=\"choiceLetterCircle\" letter=\"e\">e</div>\n                                    </td>\n                                    <td id=\"choiceEText\" class=\"choiceText\">None</td>\n                                </tr>\n                            </tbody></table> \n                              \n                    </div>",
